$, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+6y+(z-1)^{2} & =16 \\\\ {x}^{2}+({y}^{2}+6y+9)+(z-1)^{2} & =16+9 \\\\ {x}^{2}+(y+3)^{2}+(z-1)^{2} & =25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write our equation as\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+(y+3)^{2}+(z-1)^{2}={5}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhich gives us a radius of $5.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042177/state.json" "file_sha256" "d94aeaff82090a7938a0d72149a5f134f48e63b50ea71550611d24627b4ff4ab"} {"question" "q-70563" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042177/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "40c9b47f84a46075b258520c8bb344da4c894b0d0c5fd9f11b282ef313c0163f"} {"question" "q-70563" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042177/state.json" "file_sha256" "d94aeaff82090a7938a0d72149a5f134f48e63b50ea71550611d24627b4ff4ab"} {"question" "q-70563" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "16"] ["math" "25"] ["math" "3"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "5"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042177/state.json" "file_sha256" "d94aeaff82090a7938a0d72149a5f134f48e63b50ea71550611d24627b4ff4ab"} {"question" "q-70563" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042177/state.json" "file_sha256" "d94aeaff82090a7938a0d72149a5f134f48e63b50ea71550611d24627b4ff4ab"} {"question" "q-70560" "field" nil "attri